Package: insideR
Type: Package
Title: Point-in-Polygon Utilities and Simple Spatial Examples in R
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    c(person(given = "Duccio",
             family = "Rocchini",
             role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "duccio.rocchini@unibo.it",
             comment = c(ORCID = "")))
Description: Implements lightweight point-in-polygon tools (e.g., Ray Casting) and
    simple, reproducible examples for teaching and ecological coding workflows.
    The package provides functions to test whether points fall inside polygonal
    boundaries and to visualize results.
